          <svg class="w-full h-full max-h-[260px]" viewBox="0 0 300 240" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <circle cx="150" cy="120" r="100" stroke="#232B3E" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3 3" />
            <circle cx="150" cy="120" r="70" stroke="#232B3E" stroke-width="1" />
            <circle cx="150" cy="120" r="40" stroke="#232B3E" stroke-width="1" />
            <line x1="150" y1="20" x2="150" y2="220" stroke="#232B3E" stroke-width="1" />
            <line x1="50" y1="120" x2="250" y2="120" stroke="#232B3E" stroke-width="1" />
            <path d="M150 120 L240 70 A100 100 0 0 0 150 20 Z" fill="url(#radar-gradient)" opacity="0.4" />
            <g class="animate-pulse">
              <circle cx="195" cy="65" r="7" fill="#00F2FE" />
              <circle cx="195" cy="65" r="14" stroke="#00F2FE" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.6" />
              <text x="210" y="70" fill="#00F2FE" font-family="JetBrains Mono" font-size="10" font-weight="bold">暴风雪全屋应急备电 (Tier-1 空白)</text>
              <circle cx="100" cy="160" r="5" fill="#EF4444" />
              <text x="110" y="165" fill="#EF4444" font-family="JetBrains Mono" font-size="9">露营烧烤 (红海内卷·杀价泥潭)</text>
              <circle cx="190" cy="170" r="5" fill="#10B981" />
              <text x="120" y="200" fill="#94A3B8" font-family="JetBrains Mono" font-size="9">X-Stream 1小时快充 (差评解决率 100%)</text>
            </g>
            <defs>
              <radialGradient id="radar-gradient" cx="0" cy="0" r="1" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse" gradientTransform="translate(150 120) rotate(45) scale(100)">
                <stop stop-color="#00F2FE" stop-opacity="0.8"/>
                <stop offset="1" stop-color="#00F2FE" stop-opacity="0"/>
              </radialGradient>
            </defs>
          </svg>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-[#232B3E] flex justify-between items-center font-mono text-[11px]">
          <span class="text-slate-400">差评断层发现：<strong class="text-cyan-400">传统充电需8小时遇灾即瘫痪</strong></span>
          <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">众筹纪录: $12.11M</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-6 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-cyan-950/80 border border-cyan-800/60 rounded text-cyan-400 font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase mb-3">
            STAGE 01 // DEMAND RADAR
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-sans font-bold text-[24px] sm:text-[28px] text-slate-100 mb-2">
            M1 勘测心智：别盲目测款，用 AI 挖出海外差评断层
          </h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300 text-[15px] leading-relaxed mb-6 font-sans">
            彻底告别盲目测款和粗暴铺货。通过抓取海外 Reddit 与 Amazon 数万条差评，用 AI 深度聚类出买家最痛却没人解决的 5W1H 刚需场景，开辟巨头看不见的场景蓝海。
          </p>

          <div class="space-y-3.5 mb-6">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-[#09090B] p-3.5 rounded-lg border border-[#232B3E]">
              <span class="text-cyan-400 font-mono font-bold text-[14px]">01</span>
              <div>
                <div class="font-bold text-slate-200 text-[13px]">实证战例：EcoFlow 正浩便携储能品类重锚</div>
                <div class="text-slate-400 text-[12.5px] mt-0.5">从“周末露营小电宝”跳出，锁定 2021 德州暴风雪“全屋极寒应急备电”，开发 1 小时快充专利彻底解决差评痛点。</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-[#09090B] p-3.5 rounded-lg border border-[#232B3E]">
              <span class="text-emerald-400 font-mono font-bold text-[14px]">02</span>
              <div>
                <div class="font-bold text-slate-200 text-[13px]">财务成果：众筹破纪录与 10 亿美元跨越</div>
                <div class="text-slate-400 text-[12.5px] mt-0.5">Kickstarter 狂揽 $12.11M 创全球科技众筹纪录；客单价从 $299 跃升至 $3599+；年营收从 $1500 万爆发突破 10 亿美元。</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <a href="/modules/m1-brand-foundations" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[13px] font-bold text-cyan-400 hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors">
          <span>进入 M1 深度工程解析</span>
          <span>→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- PANEL M2: Patagonia & Dyson -->
    <div class="os-panel hidden grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center" id="panel-m2">
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 bg-[#09090B] border border-indigo-500/40 rounded-xl p-5 sm:p-6 relative overflow-hidden shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(99,102,241,0.06)]">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-4 pb-3 border-b border-[#232B3E]">
          <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-indigo-400 font-bold uppercase">斯宾塞昂贵信号与分离均衡</span>
          <span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-slate-500">DYSON & PATAGONIA</span>
        </div>

        <div class="relative w-full aspect-[4/3] flex items-center justify-center">
          <svg class="w-full h-full max-h-[260px]" viewBox="0 0 300 240" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <line x1="40" y1="200" x2="260" y2="200" stroke="#232B3E" stroke-width="2" />
            <polygon points="150,200 140,220 160,220" fill="#27272A" />
            <line x1="50" y1="170" x2="250" y2="130" stroke="#00F2FE" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" />
            <g transform="translate(60, 160)">
              <rect width="60" height="35" rx="6" fill="#111622" stroke="#EF4444" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              <text x="30" y="18" fill="#EF4444" font-family="JetBrains Mono" font-size="9" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle">口头自夸</text>
              <text x="30" y="28" fill="#94A3B8" font-family="JetBrains Mono" font-size="7.5" text-anchor="middle">$0 成本 / 零信任</text>
            </g>
            <g transform="translate(180, 100)">
              <rect width="80" height="42" rx="6" fill="#111622" stroke="#00F2FE" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              <text x="40" y="16" fill="#00F2FE" font-family="JetBrains Mono" font-size="9" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle">昂贵信号质押</text>
              <text x="40" y="27" fill="#E2E8F0" font-family="JetBrains Mono" font-size="7.5" text-anchor="middle">5127次原型/全透明仓</text>
              <text x="40" y="37" fill="#10B981" font-family="JetBrains Mono" font-size="7.5" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle">+100% 溢价抢购</text>
            </g>
          </svg>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-[#232B3E] flex justify-between items-center font-mono text-[11px]">
          <span class="text-slate-400">公信力机制：<strong class="text-indigo-400">假冒者模仿即破产的沉没质押</strong></span>
          <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">反向营销增收: +30%</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-6 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-indigo-950/80 border border-indigo-800/60 rounded text-indigo-400 font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase mb-3">
            STAGE 02 // UNFAKEABLE TRUST
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-sans font-bold text-[24px] sm:text-[28px] text-slate-100 mb-2">
            M2 立住人设：口头吹嘘没人信，用极端实测彻底破除防备
          </h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300 text-[15px] leading-relaxed mb-6 font-sans">
            打字写“品质优良”一文不值。用假冒者模仿即破产的高成本投入（国际权威认证、10 年包换、极限破坏性实测），在独立站建立不可动摇的公信力护城河。
          </p>

          <div class="space-y-3.5 mb-6">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-[#09090B] p-3.5 rounded-lg border border-[#232B3E]">
              <span class="text-indigo-400 font-mono font-bold text-[14px]">01</span>
              <div>
                <div class="font-bold text-slate-200 text-[13px]">实证战例：Patagonia《不要买这件夹克》反向营销</div>
                <div class="text-slate-400 text-[12.5px] mt-0.5">自建北美最大维修工厂年修 10 万件旧衣，坚持 1% 刚性收入捐赠，2022 年将 $30 亿股权全部捐赠，换来全球不可动摇的狂热崇拜。</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-[#09090B] p-3.5 rounded-lg border border-[#232B3E]">
              <span class="text-emerald-400 font-mono font-bold text-[14px]">02</span>
              <div>
                <div class="font-bold text-slate-200 text-[13px]">实证战例：Dyson 戴森 5,127 次原型与透明气旋指纹</div>
                <div class="text-slate-400 text-[12.5px] mt-0.5">手工打磨 5,127 个原型抵押房产，首创全透明航空聚碳酸酯集尘仓，让技术肉眼可见，吸尘器售价 3-5 倍于竞品，EBITDA 达 25%-30%。</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <a href="/modules/m2-behavioral-science" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[13px] font-bold text-indigo-400 hover:text-indigo-300 transition-colors">
          <span>进入 M2 深度工程解析</span>
          <span>→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- PANEL M3: YETI -->
    <div class="os-panel hidden grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center" id="panel-m3">
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 bg-[#09090B] border border-emerald-500/40 rounded-xl p-5 sm:p-6 relative overflow-hidden shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(168,85,247,0.06)]">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-4 pb-3 border-b border-[#232B3E]">
          <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-emerald-400 font-bold uppercase">Good-Better-Best 3 档阶梯定价模型</span>
          <span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-slate-500">YETI 65%+ GROSS MARGIN</span>
        </div>

        <div class="relative w-full aspect-[4/3] flex items-center justify-center">
          <svg class="w-full h-full max-h-[260px]" viewBox="0 0 300 240" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <g transform="translate(30, 130)">
              <rect width="65" height="80" rx="4" fill="#111622" stroke="#232B3E" stroke-width="1.5" />
              <text x="32" y="24" fill="#94A3B8" font-family="JetBrains Mono" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold">GOOD</text>
              <text x="32" y="42" fill="#E2E8F0" font-family="JetBrains Mono" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold">$250</text>
              <text x="32" y="60" fill="#64748B" font-family="JetBrains Mono" font-size="7.5" text-anchor="middle">降低尝试摩擦</text>
            </g>
            <g transform="translate(115, 80)">
              <rect width="70" height="130" rx="6" fill="#111622" stroke="#10B981" stroke-width="2" />
              <rect x="0" y="0" width="70" height="16" rx="4" fill="#10B981" />
              <text x="35" y="11" fill="#09090B" font-family="JetBrains Mono" font-size="8" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="extrabold">BETTER (主力)</text>
              <text x="35" y="40" fill="#10B981" font-family="JetBrains Mono" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold">$325</text>
              <text x="35" y="58" fill="#E2E8F0" font-family="JetBrains Mono" font-size="8" text-anchor="middle">贡献 70% 销量</text>
              <text x="35" y="75" fill="#34D399" font-family="JetBrains Mono" font-size="8" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold">毛利率 68%+</text>
            </g>
            <g transform="translate(205, 40)">
              <rect width="65" height="170" rx="4" fill="#111622" stroke="#00F2FE" stroke-width="1.5" />
              <text x="32" y="24" fill="#00F2FE" font-family="JetBrains Mono" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold">BEST (天花板)</text>
              <text x="32" y="44" fill="#00F2FE" font-family="JetBrains Mono" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold">$450-$800</text>
              <text x="32" y="62" fill="#94A3B8" font-family="JetBrains Mono" font-size="7.5" text-anchor="middle">树立极端溢价锚点</text>
            </g>
          </svg>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-[#232B3E] flex justify-between items-center font-mono text-[11px]">
          <span class="text-slate-400">战略毛利：<strong class="text-emerald-400">DTC 综合毛利 65%+ / 净利 23.5%</strong></span>
          <span class="text-cyan-400 font-bold">饮具连带 AOV: +48%</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-6 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-emerald-950/80 border border-emerald-800/60 rounded text-emerald-400 font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase mb-3">
            STAGE 03 // VALUE PRICING
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-sans font-bold text-[24px] sm:text-[28px] text-slate-100 mb-2">
            M3 价值定价：告别降价亏本，设计 3 档阶梯死守 65%+ 战略毛利
          </h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300 text-[15px] leading-relaxed mb-6 font-sans">
            定价不是算生产成本，而是提取买家心理账户。构建 Good-Better-Best 3 档阶梯利润沙盘，用主力旗舰款吃透 70%+ 销量，严控漏损，留足研发与获客弹药。
          </p>

          <div class="space-y-3.5 mb-6">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-[#09090B] p-3.5 rounded-lg border border-[#232B3E]">
              <span class="text-emerald-400 font-mono font-bold text-[14px]">01</span>
              <div>
                <div class="font-bold text-slate-200 text-[13px]">实证战例：YETI 酷冷箱防熊认证打破 $30 垃圾货架</div>
                <div class="text-slate-400 text-[12.5px] mt-0.5">通过 IGBC #3425 防熊撞击认证，把 $20 成本的塑料箱直接定在 $325 成为户外硬核徽章，摆脱比价泥潭。</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-[#09090B] p-3.5 rounded-lg border border-[#232B3E]">
              <span class="text-cyan-400 font-mono font-bold text-[14px]">02</span>
              <div>
                <div class="font-bold text-slate-200 text-[13px]">产品矩阵：Rambler 饮具特洛伊木马带动全店高频复购</div>
                <div class="text-slate-400 text-[12.5px] mt-0.5">推出 $35-$45 高毛利保温杯，将 5 年买一次的耐用品变为年年买的生活方式，全店 AOV 飙升 48%，实收净利润率高达 23.5%。</div>
              </div>
            </div>
